      "                                           'higher revenue per impression, in '\n",
      "                                           'turn due to higher CTR and revenue '\n",
      "                                           'per click arising from more '\n",
      "                                           'closed-loop activity with Mini '\n",
      "                                           'Shops and Mini Games\\n'\n",
      "                                           'A lesser driver was traffic growth '\n",
      "                                           'in Video Accounts and Search\\n'\n",
      "                                           'Ad load was not really a driver in '\n",
      "                                           'Q2\\n'\n",
      "                                           'You mentioned last quarter that '\n",
      "                                           '20% growth was at the upper end of '\n",
      "                                           'the growth band (~teens growth). '\n",
      "                                           'But with AI enhancement, will 20% '\n",
      "                                           'growth be the new baseline?\\n'\n",
