      "                                           'adverse impact from the food '\n",
      "                                           'delivery companies who reduced ad '\n",
      "                                           'spend as they invested more in '\n",
      "                                           \"subsidies, but Tencent's ad \"\n",
      "                                           'revenue still grew 20%\\n'\n",
      "                                           'FinTech Services\\n'\n",
      "                                           'Revenue grew by high single-digit '\n",
      "                                           '% YoY, primarily driven by '\n",
      "                                           'commercial payment services and '\n",
      "                                           'consumer loan services\\n'\n",
