      "                                           'narrowed and number of '\n",
      "                                           'transactions grew faster YoY\\n'\n",
      "                                           'Anti-involution campaign initiated '\n",
      "                                           'by the government is one driver of '\n",
      "                                           'the narrowed decline in value per '\n",
      "                                           'transaction\\n'\n",
      "                                           'Business Services\\n'\n",
      "                                           'Revenue grew teens % YoY, driven '\n",
      "                                           'by cloud services (including GPUs '\n",
      "                                           'and API tokens for AI) and fees '\n",
      "                                           'collected on Mini Shops eCommerce '\n",
      "                                           'transactions\\n'\n",
      "                                           'Gross margin increased YoY due to '\n",
      "                                           'improved efficiency and positive '\n",
      "                                           'mix shifts\\n'\n",
      "                                           'Tencent Cloud increased '\n",
      "                                           'international revenue '\n",
      "                                           'significantly YoY\\n'\n",
      "                                           'AI and CapEx\\n'\n",
      "                                           'Will delivery of AI features free '\n",
      "                                           'of charge hurt your cost '\n",
      "                                           'structure? Will you consider '\n",
      "                                           'monetising these features in the '\n",
      "                                           'near future?\\n'\n",
      "                                           'Tencent will use smaller models '\n",
      "                                           'instead of flagship models when '\n",
      "                                           'they can to lower costs, while '\n",
      "                                           'also continue to improve the '\n",
      "                                           'efficiency of inference through '\n",
      "                                           'software upgrades\\n'\n",
      "                                           'Eventually there should be some '\n",
      "                                           \"monetisation, but believes it's \"\n",
      "                                           'hard to have the paid user model '\n",
