      "                                           'China. Mgmt thinks perhaps there '\n",
      "                                           'would be some ad supported way of '\n",
      "                                           'monetizing instead\\n'\n",
      "                                           'But note that AI is already '\n",
      "                                           'contributing to growth in existing '\n",
      "                                           'businesses, which helps to fund '\n",
      "                                           'their AI initiatives\\n'\n",
      "                                           'CapEx\\n'\n",
      "                                           'Capital expenditure was RMB 19.1 '\n",
      "                                           'billion, up 119% YoY (Tencent '\n",
